WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.139 --> 00:00:06.139
Welcome to the Sequencer Introduction for Game Development course for Unreal Engine 5.5.

2
00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:14.300
This course will provide an introductory overview of game development, with a focus on Sequencer and its application to in-game cutscenes.

3
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:20.300
We'll explore the fundamentals of using Sequencer, Sequencer features, and Sequencer tools.

4
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:28.620
We'll create a simple sequence shot and explore the assembly process for developing a three-shot sequence, which will ultimately be triggered during gameplay.

5
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.620
We covered this in a separate course.

6
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:40.100
For this course, you'll find the Sequence 105 Start Map, located in your Content Browser, under Courses, Sequence 10500 Maps.

7
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.100
Let's get started.
